{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":28.540000915527344,"text":"A whole room painted across three walls, red rocks, red lilies bending in the wind, and swallows chasing each other through the sky. There is no person anywhere in it. As far as we know it, it is the oldest landscape painting in Europe. Somebody painted a place simply because it was beautiful, with no gods, no kings, and no story. And it was painted with the colors going on while the plaster was still wet.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5600000023841858},{"word":"whole","start":0.5600000023841858,"end":1.100000023841858},{"word":"room","start":1.100000023841858,"end":1.5199999809265137},{"word":"painted","start":1.5199999809265137,"end":2.180000066757202},{"word":"across","start":2.180000066757202,"end":2.680000066757202},{"word":"three","start":2.680000066757202,"end":3.119999885559082},{"word":"walls","start":3.119999885559082,"end":3.5},{"word":"red","start":4.179999828338623,"end":4.340000152587891},{"word":"rocks","start":4.340000152587891,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"red","start":5.400000095367432,"end":5.599999904632568},{"word":"lilies","start":5.599999904632568,"end":5.960000038146973},{"word":"bending","start":5.960000038146973,"end":6.340000152587891},{"word":"in","start":6.340000152587891,"end":6.539999961853027},{"word":"the","start":6.539999961853027,"end":7},{"word":"wind","start":7,"end":7},{"word":"and","start":7.420000076293945,"end":7.71999979019165},{"word":"swallows","start":7.71999979019165,"end":8.100000381469727},{"word":"chasing","start":8.100000381469727,"end":8.5600004196167},{"word":"each","start":8.5600004196167,"end":8.84000015258789},{"word":"other","start":8.84000015258789,"end":9.0600004196167},{"word":"through","start":9.0600004196167,"end":9.180000305175781},{"word":"the","start":9.180000305175781,"end":9.640000343322754},{"word":"sky","start":9.640000343322754,"end":9.640000343322754},{"word":"There","start":9.899999618530273,"end":10.380